;    1: TDecorate(count=417, unk2=2960895, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=212, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=73, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=74, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=40, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=18, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=16, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=90, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=みなかみし, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=とよたけ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=4940, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=4476, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\The_Covert.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\ホテルロビー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>We enter the hotel and get through the check-in procedure.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All the necessary paperwork is being handled by <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>, so I just wait in a chair in the lobby.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is he writing down some made-up address too?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"All right, let's go."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... the bill for this hotel..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Don't worry about it. I had online points saved up, so it didn't cost a single yen."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Thank you..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I'm the only one staying here tonight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> seems to mean to come up to my room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is he going to talk about?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\ホテル部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I sit on the edge of the bed, and <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> sits in the chair.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry, but... what I'm about to say may be a little close to an interrogation."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> seems to find it a little hard to talk too, but he doesn't look like he means to stop.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... how much do you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What I'm thinking, and what </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is thinking, how much of that do you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... what do you mean?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't see what the question is getting at. It's a question with a lot of words left out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though it seems to involve <STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE>, at least.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm... how should I put it, in this case... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Yeah, let's see. Let me tell you a bit about </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Speaking of <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE>, she's the real younger sister who's been trying to trace <STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> whereabouts.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, apart from their being sisters and best friends, I hadn't heard anything in particular.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... do you believe in psychic powers?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\歪むカオ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Psychic powers...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right. Precognition, for example."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The intuition I have, and <STYLE ID="6">Mommy</STYLE> has, could be called precognition too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd never thought of it in a category as grand as psychic powers in the first place, but true, it could be grouped that way.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The truth is, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has a strange intuition she can only use at this time of year. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When she sees or talks with someone who's likely to run into danger, she can sense that person's danger ahead of time."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are people besides me and <STYLE ID="6">Mommy</STYLE> who can do that...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And someone with no connection to the Arata settlement at all.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">before we left Zahha earlier, I said this to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">: </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">call </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> right away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............
{PAUSE ""}
.............
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It took me a few seconds to read <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san's</STYLE> intent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE> has danger sense, and having <STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE> talk with her means <STYLE ID="1">'have </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> foresee the danger.'</STYLE><PG>
In other words, <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> must have thought <STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE> might be in danger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Reaching that thought wasn't very hard for me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because it was exactly me who was going to kill <STYLE ID="3">Erina Goto</STYLE> tonight.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Don't you have something to say?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Huh? Do I need to say anything?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After all, <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> suspects I'll put <STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE> in danger, doesn't he?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He's probably already heard that I'm planning to kill <STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE> too, hasn't he?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's nothing I can say, is there?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Not really... nothing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without looking at <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>, I spat the words at the floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see. Then that's fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Well then, I'll come pick you up here 30 minutes before the first train tomorrow."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> left the room without even saying good night.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I collapse onto the bed just as I am.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't want to know anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not what <STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE> did, not that there are people searching for <STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
and not what will happen once everyone reaches <STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I knew nothing, all I'd have to do is go back to the Arata settlement and have <STYLE ID="8">Daddy</STYLE> cure my green eyes.<PG>
If I do nothing here in Motoki-cho―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sooner or later <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE> will use me as a foothold to reach the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And <STYLE ID="8">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="6">Mommy</STYLE> will be arrested, and <STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE> will reject everyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What comes after that, I don't even want to know.<PG>
If I'm going to avoid that, I have to take some kind of action after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At first I meant to kill <STYLE ID="3">Erina Goto</STYLE>, but if <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE> really has precognition like mine, <STYLE ID="3">Erina Goto</STYLE> will be on her guard more than usual, and eliminating her will become harder.<PG>
Why did <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> tell me that in the first place?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's simple. He was telling me to think better of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that's not what matters.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How did he figure out I'm trying to kill <STYLE ID="3">Erina Goto</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did I let something slip without meaning to...?<PG>
Rather than me carelessly telling <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>, was there something in my conversation with <STYLE ID="8">Daddy</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The smartphone I borrowed apparently has a bug built into it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What did I say back then?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll try to remember my conversation with <STYLE ID="8">Daddy</STYLE> properly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署外観夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\バース\携帯クリ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> should have precognition like </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mommy's</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Probably, anywhere there are cherry trees, you can foresee danger wherever you are. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Use it and stay safe, you hear?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\ホテル部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
That's it! <STYLE ID="8">Daddy</STYLE> said my precognition had awakened!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> heard it too, it's no wonder he told me about <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi Kogori's</STYLE> precognition, and it's easy to predict that sooner or later <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> and the others will come to the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And that I'd kill <STYLE ID="3">Erina Goto</STYLE> to prevent it is, in the worst case, entirely possible.<PG>
Up against a bug and a police officer, it's hard to move, no matter how much precognition I have.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On top of that, both <STYLE ID="3">Erina Goto</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE> have probably found out about me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have far too many enemies.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>, who I thought I might be able to trust, is moving to stop me in the end.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the first place, the moment he handed me a smartphone with a bug in it, he didn't trust me at all.<PG>
Now... what should I do from here?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
First, I mustn't lose sight of my goal.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are two things I must do―
{PAUSE ""}
keep <STYLE ID="8">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="6">Mommy</STYLE> from being arrested, and keep <STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE> from meeting the police.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I can do that, I should at least be able to avoid the tragic ending I foresaw earlier.<PG>
That's why I meant to kill <STYLE ID="3">Erina Goto</STYLE>, but I'd definitely be suspected as the culprit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I need a more fundamental solution.<PG>
All it takes is for <STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE> not to meet the police.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="8">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="6">Mommy</STYLE> won't be arrested either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, if I can just move <STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE> out of Arata, that's enough.<PG>
I hurry up off the bed and start getting ready to leave the room right away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no time to hesitate anymore. I have to get back to the Arata settlement as soon as I possibly can...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The time now is 20:30.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know how far I can get from here...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once I reach the last stop, I'll just have to run all night toward the Arata settlement.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
I set the borrowed smartphone gently on the bed, careful not to make a sound.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>, I'm sorry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For me, after all... 
{PAUSE ""}
there are people I want to protect, even if it means making a mistake.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "Shadows_creeping.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\ホテルロビー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I go to the front desk and, holding down my impatience, ask where the nearest station is.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
10 minutes from here by taxi―
{PAUSE ""}
which means if I run, I can get there within 20 minutes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I decided to run to Motoki Station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Getting caught in a traffic jam like the one I saw in <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="みなかみし">Minakami City</STYLE> is the last thing I need.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\夜桜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
As I was told, I keep going straight down the bigger road.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the way there were traffic lights, and several lines of about 10 cars.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as I thought, whether I run or take a taxi, the time probably wouldn't be much different.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\駅前夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Arrival time, 20:40.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This must be the area in front of Motoki Station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll catch a train toward Iizawa Prefecture now. How far will it take me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll ask the station attendant.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\改札.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Excuse me, from here... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">um... which train gets to </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="とよたけ">Toyotake</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> Station the soonest!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I call out loudly to the station attendant at the ticket gate, who'd been yawning, bored.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Toyotake Station...?
{PAUSE ""}
　Um, was there a station like that..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Toyotake Station in Iizawa Prefecture!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Iizawa Prefecture...?
{PAUSE ""}
　Ah, that's quite far. 
{PAUSE ""}
You won't get there today, you know?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's fine! Which train gets me even a little closer to Toyotake Station!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Um... with today's trains... 
{PAUSE ""}
there's an express train bound for Megasawa Station coming in 10 minutes, I think. 
{PAUSE ""}
Megasawa Station is the last stop."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"From Megasawa Station to Toyotake Station... about how many kilometers is it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"How many kilometers?
{PAUSE ""}
　Must be 100 kilometers, at least..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Understood! Thank you!"</STYLE><PG>
―My plan has more or less taken shape.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll take the express train to Megasawa now, and from there run on my own two feet along the tracks toward Toyotake, without stopping.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since I'll be running nonstop until the sun comes up, even I will probably use up a lot of stamina.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or should I have <STYLE ID="8">Daddy</STYLE> come get me now?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But in the buggy, that would be pretty rough.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\駅ホーム.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\元木駅ホーム夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I'll call <STYLE ID="8">Daddy</STYLE> once I get to Megasawa.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unusually for someone my age, I'm used to using public phones.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I even have a phone card, a relic of the past these days.<PG>
Come to think of it, <STYLE ID="3">Goto-san</STYLE> mentioned it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Today, <STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> real younger sister, <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE>, is coming.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She's supposed to arrive at Motoki Station around 9 p.m., so maybe we'll pass each other.
{PAUSE ""}
